  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"f", "(", "0", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "811e535c-2d72-4a22-9933-d6a404ad2350"],
 " is 0.053256, not 0.001 as it is supposed to be."
}], "Text",
